# Shifting a <%= Basket.model_name.human.downcase %> outside the delivery cycle

Members who can already shift a <%= Basket.model_name.human.downcase %> can now move one to a date their delivery cycle does not include, from their deliveries page, without declaring an absence first. Typical cases: the in-between week of an every-other-week cycle, or another weekday, for example Friday when the membership is on Monday.

The shift deadline you already set applies, and the depot must be served that day. It counts as one shift, toward the same annual limit. There is no extra setting: this appears as soon as member shifts are enabled.

Details in [the absence handbook](/handbook/absence#basket-shift).
